    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Bulk modeling datasets used to develop fecal indicator bacteria (FIB) forecast models. Datasets contain all FIB types and hundreds of environmental variables from the following types: tide, wave, meteorological, water quality, stream flow, ocean currents. There are missing values that must be cleaned prior to fitting models.",
